sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant K as Koin
    participant CM as configModule
    participant SM as sttModule
    participant A as AppSettings
    participant S as SpeechToTextSettings
    participant EC as SttEngineConfig
    participant CST as createSpeechToText()
    participant ST as SttService
    Note over K: Application starts<br/>Koin modules loaded
    K->>CM: load configModule
    CM-->>K: provides AppSettings.default()
    K->>CM: resolve AppSettings
    CM-->>K: AppSettings instance
    K->>CM: resolve SpeechToTextSettings
    CM-->>K: AppSettings.stt
    Note over S: Contains provider + engineConfig
    K->>SM: load sttModule
    K->>SM: resolve SttService
    SM->>S: request SpeechToTextSettings
    S-->>SM: provider + engineConfig
    SM->>EC: read engineConfig<br/>(VoskConfig, WhisperConfig, etc.)
    EC-->>SM: engine-specific config
    SM->>CST: call createSpeechToText(settings)
    CST->>CST: dispatch based on provider<br/>and engineConfig type
    CST-->>SM: SttService instance
    SM-->>K: SttService
    K-->>ST: inject SttService into UI layer